/** @defgroup stream_adapters_api Stream adapters API
 * @ingroup stream_api
 *
 * @brief Adapter-facing contracts for the `stream` port.
 *
 * @details
 * Exposes the contracts required to implement `stream` adapters.
 *
 * This group aggregates the callback, provider, and common types shared
 * between the `stream` port implementation and adapter modules, including
 * status codes, backend operation callback types, dispatch-table types,
 * adapter provider types, and stream creation argument structures.
 */
